        {
          "append": {
            "key": "pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(played) < k"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "played",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(played) < k"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sorted([((c - required_rank) % num_ranks) * num_ranks + c - 1 for c in players[active_seat - 1].hand])[0] % num_ranks + 1"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(played) < k"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(played) < k"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(played) < k"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "played",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(played) < k"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sorted([((c - required_rank) % num_ranks) * num_ranks + c - 1 for c in players[active_seat - 1].hand])[0] % num_ranks + 1"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(played) < k"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(played) < k"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(played) < k"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "played",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(played) < k"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand_size",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(you.hand)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pile_size",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(pile)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "play_true",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(c == required_rank for c in played) == k"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "play",
      "label": "the claim",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not skipped"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Seat {active_seat} claims {k} cards of rank {required_rank}. Statement: {statement}"
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "respond",
      "label": "trust or challenge",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not skipped"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat != active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "Trust",
          "Challenge"
        ]
      },
      "store": "response",
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} chooses {value}."
      },
      "text": "Seat {active_seat} claims {k} cards of rank {required_rank}. Trust or Challenge? If anyone challenges, the cards are revealed. A challenged bluff sends the whole pile to the active player; a challenged true play sends the whole pile to a single challenger, or splits it between two challengers. If both trust, nothing happens. Trusting never gives you cards."
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "respond",
      "label": "reveal the played cards",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not skipped and count(p.response == 'Challenge' for p in players) > 0"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Challenged! Seat {active_seat}'s {k} played cards were: {played}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "bluff caught",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not skipped and count(p.response == 'Challenge' for p in players) > 0 and not play_true"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "challengers",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(p.response == 'Challenge' for p in players)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand + pile"
            },
            "text": "It was a bluff. Seat {player} takes the whole pile."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "caught",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.response == 'Challenge'"
            },
            "key": "catches",
            "value": 1,
            "text": "Seat {player} scores a catch."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pile_size",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand_size",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(you.hand)"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "true play, one challenger",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not skipped and count(p.response == 'Challenge' for p in players) == 1 and play_true"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "challengers",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(p.response == 'Challenge' for p in players)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.response == 'Challenge'"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand + pile"
            },
            "text": "The play was true. Seat {player} takes the whole pile."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pile_size",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand_size",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(you.hand)"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "repeat",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "true play, two challengers",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not skipped and count(p.response == 'Challenge' for p in players) == 2 and play_true"
      },
      "until": {
        "calc": "len(pile) == 0"
      },
      "max": 20,
      "steps": [
        {
          "use": "update",
          "label": "split the pile",
          "do": [
            {
              "set": {
                "key": "pick",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "pile[int(uniform(0, len(pile)))]"
                },
                "if": {
                  "calc": "len(pile) > pile_size % 2"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "append": {
                "player": {
                  "calc": "min([p.seat for p in players if p.response == 'Challenge'])"
                },
                "key": "hand",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "pick"
                },
                "if": {
                  "calc": "len(pile) > pile_size % 2"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "remove": {
                "key": "pile",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "pick"
                },
                "if": {
                  "calc": "len(pile) > pile_size % 2"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "set": {
                "key": "pick",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "pile[int(uniform(0, len(pile)))]"
                },
                "if": {
                  "calc": "len(pile) > pile_size % 2"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "append": {
                "player": {
                  "calc": "max([p.seat for p in players if p.response == 'Challenge'])"
                },
                "key": "hand",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "pick"
                },
                "if": {
                  "calc": "len(pile) > pile_size % 2"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "remove": {
                "key": "pile",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "pick"
                },
                "if": {
                  "calc": "len(pile) > pile_size % 2"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "set": {
                "key": "pick",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "pile[0]"
                },
                "if": {
                  "calc": "len(pile) == 1"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "append": {
                "key": "removed",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "pick"
                },
                "if": {
                  "calc": "len(pile) == 1"
                },
                "text": "One card is left over and removed from the game face down."
              }
            },
            {
              "remove": {
                "key": "pile",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "pick"
                },
                "if": {
                  "calc": "len(pile) == 1"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "set": {
                "key": "challengers",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "count(p.response == 'Challenge' for p in players)"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "set": {
                "players": "all",
                "key": "hand_size",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "len(you.hand)"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "set": {
                "key": "pile_size",
                "value": 0,
                "if": {
                  "calc": "len(pile) == 0"
                },
                "text": "The play was true. The shuffled pile is split evenly between the two challengers."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "the standings",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "End of round {round}. Hand sizes: Seat 1 {players[0].hand_size}, Seat 2 {players[1].hand_size}, Seat 3 {players[2].hand_size}. Pile: {pile_size}. Catches: Seat 1 {players[0].catches}, Seat 2 {players[1].catches}, Seat 3 {players[2].catches}. Caught: Seat 1 {players[0].caught}, Seat 2 {players[1].caught}, Seat 3 {players[2].caught}."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "after the last round",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= total_rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= total_rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "0 - you.hand_size * 10000 + you.catches * 100 - you.caught",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Cards in hand: Seat 1 {players[0].hand_size}, Seat 2 {players[1].hand_size}, Seat 3 {players[2].hand_size}. Catches: {players[0].catches}/{players[1].catches}/{players[2].catches}. Caught: {players[0].caught}/{players[1].caught}/{players[2].caught}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 25,
    "rounds_max": 25,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "SETUP. The deck has {deck_size} cards: ranks 1 to {num_ranks}, {copies_per_rank} copies of each. It is shuffled and {hand_size_initial} cards are dealt to each of seats 1, 2 and 3. Hands are private. Everyone always knows every hand size and the pile size. The central pile starts empty; its cards are face down. Each player has two public counters starting at 0: CATCHES (correct challenges) and CAUGHT (times caught bluffing).\n\nROUNDS. The game lasts exactly {total_rounds} rounds. In round r the active player is seat ((r-1) mod 3)+1 and the required rank is ((r-1) mod 6)+1. As a result, seat 1 always faces ranks 1 and 4, seat 2 faces ranks 2 and 5, and seat 3 faces ranks 3 and 6. Each seat is active {turns_per_seat} times.\n\nEACH ROUND:\n1. The round, the active player and the required rank are announced.\n2. If the active player holds 0 cards, they skip: no cards move, no poll is held, and the round goes to step 8. Otherwise the active player privately chooses k from {k_min} to {k_max}. If k exceeds their hand size, k becomes their hand size. They may add one short public statement, which may be untrue.\n3. The engine moves k cards from the active player's hand onto the top of the pile. It takes cards of the required rank first, up to k. If more are needed, it takes cards of the next rank up, then the next, counting 6 as followed by 1. The play is TRUE if all k cards are the required rank; otherwise it is a BLUFF. This is recorded privately.\n4. It is announced: 'Seat X claims k cards of rank R', plus the statement.\n5. Simultaneous poll: each of the two other players secretly chooses Trust or Challenge. The choices are revealed together.\n6. If anyone challenged, the k played cards are revealed to all.\n   (a) If the play was a BLUFF: the active player takes the entire pile into their hand, and the pile becomes empty. The active player's CAUGHT increases by 1. Each challenger's CATCHES increases by 1.\n   (b) If the play was TRUE and there was one challenger: that challenger takes the entire pile into their hand. No CATCHES or CAUGHT change.\n   (c) If the play was TRUE and there were two challengers: the pile is shuffled. Each challenger takes half of it, rounded down. If one card remains, it is removed from the game face down. The pile becomes empty.\n7. If both players chose Trust, nothing happens. The cards stay face down in the pile, true or not.\n8. Every player's hand size, the pile size and all CATCHES and CAUGHT counters are announced.\n9. If round {total_rounds} has been played, the game ends.\n\nA player holding 0 cards still answers every poll. Trusting can never give them cards.\n\nWINNING. After round {total_rounds}, the player holding the fewest cards wins. If several players tie for fewest, the one with the most CATCHES wins. If still tied, the one with the fewest CAUGHT wins. If still tied, those players share the win."
}
